    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Uku ni ko jewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyeninganji mvuze: ‘Irembo ry’urugo rw’imbere riraba mu buseruko rizokwugarwe mu misi itandatu y’akazi, ariko ku musi w’Isabato canke ku musi w’imboneko z’ukwezi rize ryugururwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami aze yinjire aciye mw’ibaraza y’iryo rembo, ahagarare ku bikingi vy’irembo. Abaherezi bazoshikane amashikanwa yiwe yo guturirwa, hamwe n’ay’ishimwe. Azokubite amavi hasi mu rwinjiriro asenge, aheze asohoke, ariko umuryango ntuzokwugarwe gushika ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi w’Isabato no ku mboneko z’ukwezi, abanyagihugu bose bazosengere imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ku rwinjiro rw’iryo rembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amashikanwa yo guturirwa kw’Isabato azozanwa n’umwami azobe amasuguru y’imyagazi y’intama atandatu hamwe n’impfizi y’intama, vyose bizobe bitagira agasembwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishikanwa ry’ifu ryo gutangana n’impfizi y’intama rizobe ingero efa imwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilo 16.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", na yo iy’ifu ijana n’umwagazi, azotange iyingana uko ashatse, iri kumwe n’ingero hini imwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amalitiro 3,8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ihwana n’ingero efa imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi mukuru w’imboneko z’ukwezi na ho azotange impfizi y’inka y’umukangara, imyagazi itandatu, impfizi imwe y’intama, kandi vyose bizobe ibitagira agasembwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo mpfizi y’inka azoyitangane n’ingero efa imwe y’ishikanwa ry’ifu, umwagazi w’intama azowutangane n’ingero efa imwe y’ishikanwa ry’ifu, impfizi y’intama na yo azoyitangane n’ingero ashaka y’ishikanwa ry’ifu, kandi ingero efa yose azoyitangane n’ingero hini imwe y’amavuta ya elayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami niyinjira azoce mw’ibaraza ryo kw’irembo, kandi abe ari ho azoca mu gusohoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bo muri iki gihugu nibaza imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ku misi mikuru itegekanijwe, uwuzokwinjirana umuryango wa ruguru aje gusenga azosohokane uwo hepfo, uwuzokwinjirira mu wo hepfo na we azosohokane mu wo haruguru. Ntihazogire uwusohoka aciye mu wo yinjiriyemwo, ahubwo azoce mu wo ku rundi ruhande birabana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami azobe ari hagati muri bo, aze yinjirane n’abandi yongere asohokane na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku misi mikuru itegekanijwe, ishikanwa ry’ifu rizobe ingero efa imwe ijana n’impfizi y’inka, ingero efa imwe ijana n’impfizi y’intama, ariko ku yijana n’umwagazi azobikore uko ashatse, n’ingero hini imwe y’amavuta ya elayo ize ijane n’ingero efa imwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami niyashaka gushikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ishikanwa rivuye ku gushaka kwiwe, ryaba ari ishikanwa ryo guturirwa canke iry’ishimwe, aze yugururirwe irembo ry’amaja mu buseruko. Azotange ishikanwa ryiwe ryo guturirwa canke ry’ishimwe, nk’uko ahora abigenza ku musi w’Isabato. Ahejeje asohoke, hanyuma umuryango usubire wugarwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku musi muzotange umwagazi w’intama umaze umwaka umwe, utagira agasembwa nk’ikimazi co guturirwa gishikaniwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; muzogitange mu gitondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muzowutangane n’ishikanwa ry’ifu igitondo cose, na ryo rizoba rigizwe n’ica gatandatu c’ingero efa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilo 2,7.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " n’ica gatatu c’ingero hini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ilitiro 1,3.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " y’amavuta ya elayo yo gutosa iyo fu. Iki ni icagezwe c’intahava ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero umwagazi, ishikanwa ry’ifu hamwe n’amavuta bizotangwe igitondo cose nk’ikimazi co guturirwa co ku musi.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
