          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze aca anjana mu kigo c’inyuma, anzungurukana mu mfuruka zaco zose, maze mu mfuruka zaco zose mbonayo ikindi kigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mfuruka zine zose hari ibindi bigo bizitiye, bifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ine z’uburebure na mirongo itatu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’imetero 21 z’uburebure n’imetero 16 z’ubwaguke.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’ubwaguke, ivyo bigo vyose vyo mu mfuruka zine vyarangana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbere mu kigo cose hari hakikujwe n’ahantu batekera ivyokurya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arambwira ati: “Aha ni aho bazohora batekera ibimazi vyashikanywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
